# Design Narrative
# Mechanic: Cast a Siege, attack it, then cast its transformed back face.
# Forcing: Awakened Skyclave can enter only after the Siege loses its defense.
# AI behavior: No blockers, spells, or combat choices.
# Failure modes: Missing back face identifies a blocked defeat or free-cast flow.
# Card roles: Invasion of Zendikar is the Siege; Centaur Courser deals exactly
# three combat damage; four Forests pay the spell; library basics feed its search.
# Protocol path: Cast, search, attacker declaration, counters, and optional cast.
[metadata]
